# Module 6: MediaPipe's WASM runtime, copied out of node_modules by
# scripts/copy-mediapipe-wasm.mjs before dev/build. ~35MB of binary that
# `npm install` can reproduce exactly, so it does not belong in git.
# The face model beside it (face_landmarker.task) IS committed: it is not in
# any package, so losing it would mean re-downloading from Google by hand.
public/models/wasm/
